WEBVTT

00:13:33.058 --> 00:13:34.518
Did you feel that?

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.607
Did you feel that?

00:13:44.152 --> 00:13:46.029
If you felt that ...

00:13:48.198 --> 00:13:50.284
then something beautiful just happened.

00:13:51.952 --> 00:13:56.290
We all came into this room
defined by our differences.

00:13:56.748 --> 00:14:00.043
Men, women, old, young, Black, white.